WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.175
The program adds its rules on
top, marked as design guidance.

2
00:00:04.175 --> 00:00:06.662
Owners review every grant each quarter.

3
00:00:06.662 --> 00:00:11.774
No broad tenant-wide permission stands
without a written, dated justification.

4
00:00:11.774 --> 00:00:15.932
Where Learn documents a narrower
replacement, like selected sites,

5
00:00:15.932 --> 00:00:18.307
or scoped mail access, that's the target,

6
00:00:18.307 --> 00:00:22.613
and for mail the old unscoped grant
has to go or the scope means nothing.

7
00:00:22.613 --> 00:00:26.913
Managed identities get Azure roles at
the resource, not the subscription.

8
00:00:26.913 --> 00:00:30.750
Privileged service principals belong
to the Privileged Access plan.

9
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.650
And the code removes
a grant, never an app.
